# Backend Area Instructions

- Put business invariants and authorization on the trusted server boundary.
- Preserve API compatibility or provide an approved version/migration path.
- Define validation, typed errors, idempotency, transactions, retries, timeouts, and audit events.
- Do not log secrets or sensitive payloads.
- Add tests for permission, invalid input, duplicate requests, failure, and rollback paths.
- External writes and production changes follow explicit approval and release policy.
